v1.4.2/meryl-1.4.2.Darwin-arm64.tar.xz
tar -xJf meryl-1.4.2.Darwin-arm64.tar.x
Gularis kmer count: meryl-1.4.2 % meryl count k=21 threads=4 memory=8
\
